Modified in 2026 by Iman Babajani. The modifications introduce local device
state caching, access to Gateway services through an authenticated Unix-domain
socket manager, and local scenario RPC forwarding over IPC. The public copy
reads IPC authentication keys from environment variables and does not print
cached device telemetry directly to standard output.

